<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_03f999f43342b523ef8ea8334b7569ba6a8408421e54b30f8f8a2513456bec53_n0002/e_0016/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingMethod> "NONE" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_03f999f43342b523ef8ea8334b7569ba6a8408421e54b30f8f8a2513456bec53_n0002/tu_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Maintain specific body weight Understand and comply with sodium restriction Demonstrate how to read a food label to check sodium amount per serving and sort foods into high- and low-sodium groups Reiterate limits for alcohol consumption or need for abstinence if history of alcohol abuse" .
